@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' purpose: how a kept sbx sandbox becomes a safe local IDE target after the agent exits
' status: applied 2026-09-17; live and remote attach remain deliberately unsupported.
' covers: internal/backend/sandbox/sandbox.go
' covers: internal/backend/sandbox/home_access.go
' covers: internal/sbx/sbx.go
' covers: internal/sbx/run.go
' covers: packages/lib/entrypoint-lib.sh
' covers: internal/backend/sandbox/sandbox_test.go
' covers: internal/backend/sandbox/home_access_test.go
' covers: internal/contract/config_files_test.go
' covers: cmd/proveo/golden_test.go
' covers: cmd/proveo/main_test.go
' covers: e2e/home_test.go
'   clone return path ........ _spec/internal/sbx/clone-workspace.puml
'   wider post-close UI ...... _spec/_plans/post-close-surface.puml
'   workspace boundary ....... _spec/_paradigms/workspace-boundary.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' LOCAL, AFTER EXIT, KEPT. The failed run is already retained for diagnosis.
' proveo now names the upstream SSH setup and <sandbox>.sbx host only there,
' after the agent has exited. A successful run still tears its sandbox down.
' A live attach would create two writers; a remote attach is not established.
'
' TRANSPORT STAYS UPSTREAM. proveo neither implements SSH nor branches on an
' SSH client's status, so MinVersion is not raised for this. `sbx setup ssh`
' owns the host config; init still pins Release 0.42.
'
' THE HOME VIEW NARROWS BEFORE THE OFFER. Instead of the whole PROVEO_HOME,
' sbx gets this harness's declared config dirs, toolchains, and a run-scoped
' staging dir for declared home-root files. Logs from unrelated runs are not
' mounted. The root files copy back after the in-VM save; newest wins.
'
' WHICH TREE IS LOUD. Direct mode says that IDE saves write the host checkout.
' Clone mode says DISPOSABLE CLONE, requires commits, and prints the exact git
' fetch into refs/proveo/<sid> before the operator removes the sandbox.
title IDE attach — upstream SSH, after exit,\nwith one writer and a narrow home view

node "operator host" as HOST <<host>> {
  component """sbx setup ssh""\nupstream-owned config" as SETUP <<app>>
  component "editor\nconnects to <sid>.sbx" as IDE <<app>>
  database "host checkout" as TREE <<db>>
  database """refs/proveo/<sid>""\ncarried clone commits" as REFS <<db>>
  database "PROVEO_HOME\nother run logs stay hidden" as HOME <<db>>
}

node "kept sandbox" as BOX <<host>> {
  component "agent\nalready exited" as EXIT <<app>>
  component "mounted checkout\nor private clone" as WORK <<app>>
  database "narrow host view\nharness dirs · tools · files" as NARROW <<db>>
}

component "live attach\ntwo writers" as LIVE <<error>>
component "remote attach\nnot established" as REMOTE <<error>>

EXIT ARROW_MAIN IDE : post-close offer
SETUP ARROW_MAIN IDE : <sid>.sbx
IDE ARROW_MAIN WORK
TREE ARROW_MAIN WORK : direct mode
WORK ARROW_QUEUE REFS : clone mode: commit,\nthen fetch
HOME ARROW_MAIN NARROW : selected paths only
IDE ARROW_ERROR LIVE : not offered
IDE ARROW_ERROR REMOTE : local target only

note bottom of IDE
  **Upstream transport.** proveo prints the
  setup command and SSH host. It does not wrap
  an SSH session, inspect exit 255, or maintain
  ControlMaster policy; upstream owns those.
end note

note bottom of WORK
  **One tree, named before editing.** Direct
  writes the checkout. Clone writes a disposable
  copy: commit there, then fetch its branches
  into proveo-owned refs before removal.
end note

note bottom of NARROW
  **No transcript directory.** The whole home
  root is not a workspace. Only this harness's
  declared dirs, toolchains and staged root
  files cross into the sandbox.
end note

note right of LIVE
  **After exit is the feature boundary.** A
  running agent plus an editor is two writers
  with stale buffers and no mediation. proveo
  offers no command for that state.
end note

legend bottom
  **Implemented contract**
  ==
  A failed sbx run remains kept. If it still exists, results name `sbx setup
  ssh`, `<sid>.sbx`, and the workspace only after the agent process returned.
  --
  Direct mode names host writes. Clone mode names disposal, requires a commit,
  and prints the fetch destination under `refs/proveo/<sid>`.
  --
  The sbx workspace list excludes the whole proveo home. Root config files use
  `PROVEO_CONFIG_FILES_ROOT`; the save copies newer staged files back atomically.
end legend
@enduml
